Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pkexec, grub-common, ca-certificates
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ system identity and default settings
 Operating system identity (os-release), desktop defaults (theme, layout,
 fonts, power and privacy settings), boot menu theme selection, compressed
 RAM swap (zram), NetworkManager setup and the APT policy that keeps Snap
 out (Firefox, if installed, comes from Mozilla's own repository). Session
 helpers run monitors at their highest refresh rate, keep the theme and
 window effects in step with the wallpaper, and restart into Windows on
 dual-boot machines.
